  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When i am in VRChat, i opened Unity and add another avatar to the list, so upload new one.\n\nI noticed my avatar list \"Uploaded\" didn't even change it, so that is kinda weird. It does show up in website list, but ingame, it doesn't update with new avatars.\n\nOnly if you close and start VRChat, then it will update it. But this is weird. Normal avatar listings, all favorite listsings, does update ingame when add or remove avatar. But Uploaded part doesn't update. \n\nI am sure this is not good, because i am sure some players want add something quickly to show to others but that is not possible. They're forced to restart VRChat. Well this way they cannot show off immediately new uploaded avatars... It's a shame actually.\n\nMaybe it's forgotten to code it. Is this not an update bug? I wait for the answer.",
